    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "beat-02",
      "text": "First, I wrapped it in compliments. Then, an apology.",
      "start": 4.17,
      "end": 8.53,
      "delivery": "Speak with gentle embarrassment as you remember trying too hard to be polite. Let both sentences belong to one connected thought, without laughing.",
      "pause_after_ms": 200
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "beat-03",
      "text": "By the time I pressed send, the actual question had disappeared.",
