      "pause_after_ms": 600
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "beat-04",
      "text": "So I tried again. Fewer words. No performance. Just: what am I agreeing to?",
      "start": 13.33,
      "end": 20.55,
      "delivery": "Speak calmly and clearly as you find a simpler way to ask. Let the short sentences settle naturally, then ask the final question with genuine curiosity.",
      "pause_after_ms": 500
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "beat-05",
      "text": "The question didn't become rude when I made it clear. It became possible to answer.",
